#. translators: %s: store currency code.
#: src/WooCommerce/AdminNotices.php:52
#, php-format
msgid "The store currency is %s, but Zeny takes Indonesian rupiah (IDR) only, so Zeny is hidden at checkout. Set the currency under WooCommerce > Settings > General."
msgstr ""

#: src/WooCommerce/AdminNotices.php:56
msgid "There is no valid secret API key, so Zeny is hidden at checkout. Add the key under WooCommerce > Settings > Payments > Zeny."
msgstr ""

#: src/WooCommerce/AdminNotices.php:59
msgid "There is no webhook secret, so paid orders are not updated. Add the webhook endpoint in the Zeny dashboard and paste its secret under WooCommerce > Settings > Payments > Zeny."
